WEBVTT

00:01.790 --> 00:06.530
<i>There once was a powerless prince who 
saved a kingdom with his tiny courage.</i>

00:07.660 --> 00:10.110
<i>The courage to face challenges...</i>

00:10.110 --> 00:12.060
<i>The courage to never give up...</i>

00:12.470 --> 00:14.650
<i>The courage to trust others...</i>

00:15.500 --> 00:20.180
<i>A treasure chest of untold courage 
is now about to be opened.</i>

00:27.130 --> 00:33.550
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

00:27.130 --> 00:33.550
<b>— The Treasure Chest of Courage —</b>

00:36.500 --> 00:41.260
<i>The callous absurdity I've 
carried with me since birth</i>

00:41.260 --> 00:46.930
<i>meant playing shadow tag to find my next meal</i>

00:47.480 --> 00:50.690
<i>Bit by bit, my heart got bent out of shape</i>

00:50.690 --> 00:53.710
<i>until I tuned out both 
the cheers and the jeers</i>

00:55.910 --> 01:00.580
<i>That's how I survived my initial loneliness</i>

01:00.580 --> 01:05.590
<i>Night falls and the darkness grows</i>

01:06.000 --> 01:10.810
<i>blending in, coalescing</i>

01:11.120 --> 01:15.570
<i>around so trivial a fate as my own</i>

01:15.570 --> 01:18.380
<i>Hey, I want to get through to you</i>

01:18.380 --> 01:22.420
<i>though I may only know commonplace words</i>

01:23.930 --> 01:26.740
<i>It's so frustrating having to be like this</i>

01:26.740 --> 01:29.670
<i>Hey, never mind that it may not be easy</i>

01:29.670 --> 01:34.080
<i>to become angry or let yourself cry</i>

01:35.190 --> 01:38.770
<i>because someone could be listening in</i>

01:38.770 --> 01:41.990
<i>The only thing that's 
certain is the temperature</i>

01:44.250 --> 01:49.170
<i>whether or not we can speak heart to heart</i>

01:52.420 --> 01:55.720
<i>After the fighting was over, 
Bojji took the throne as king.</i>

01:56.470 --> 02:01.570
<i>However, his best friend, Kage, 
had secretly disappeared.</i>

02:02.180 --> 02:06.390
<b>Bojji the King</b>

02:25.590 --> 02:29.350
Many scars remain from all the fighting.

02:29.350 --> 02:31.520
As it stands, this budget 
will not be enough.

02:31.830 --> 02:34.170
Somehow, we must raise more funding.

02:34.170 --> 02:37.330
The deterioration of the soldiers' 
barracks is also becoming an issue.

02:37.760 --> 02:40.010
How are we going to address that?

02:51.280 --> 02:52.750
<i>King Bojji...</i>

02:59.540 --> 03:04.120
King Bojji, do you not miss your 
friend now that he is gone?

03:05.390 --> 03:06.750
I see.

03:07.400 --> 03:10.430
I was thinking of going into 
town to conduct an inspection.

03:10.430 --> 03:12.220
How would you like to 
come along, King Bojji?

03:13.470 --> 03:14.300
Hokuro!

03:14.300 --> 03:15.760
Y-Yes, sir!

03:15.760 --> 03:18.340
We're going into town. You come with us.

03:18.340 --> 03:20.110
A-As you wish, sir!

03:21.530 --> 03:25.050
<i>I'm always a bit awkward 
around Master Bebin.</i>

03:25.530 --> 03:27.050
<i>He has that scowl and everything.</i>

03:31.830 --> 03:33.850
The town has mostly recovered,

03:33.850 --> 03:36.960
and it's on its way to being 
as busy as it was before.

03:38.370 --> 03:40.630
Oh, King Bojji...

03:40.630 --> 03:42.330
Go on, children.

03:47.380 --> 03:48.880
Hello.

03:48.880 --> 03:50.820
Hi!

03:48.880 --> 03:50.820
Hi!

03:58.320 --> 03:59.220
King Bojji!

03:59.530 --> 04:01.660
King Bojji!

04:02.000 --> 04:05.370
Aw, not again. King Bojji...

04:33.270 --> 04:35.100
My clothes!

04:35.100 --> 04:36.880
Crying won't do any good.

04:36.880 --> 04:38.170
Just give them up.

04:45.380 --> 04:47.630
What's this? He can borrow those?

04:47.990 --> 04:49.000
You're sure?

04:53.360 --> 04:54.700
Thanks.

04:57.600 --> 04:59.960
Ha-ha! They're baggy on you!

05:00.580 --> 05:03.670
Say, are you by any chance the king?

05:03.670 --> 05:04.810
Huh?!

05:05.510 --> 05:07.500
You're right! It is the king!

05:09.360 --> 05:11.890
Wait up, King!

05:22.300 --> 05:24.250
King Bojji!

05:24.590 --> 05:26.790
King Bojji, thank goodness you're safe!

05:26.790 --> 05:28.160
H-Huh?

05:29.340 --> 05:31.040
K-King Bojji?!

05:32.250 --> 05:34.430
The king let me borrow his clothes.

05:34.700 --> 05:37.390
My clothes got ruined, you see.

05:37.390 --> 05:41.340
King Bojji, you're always much too kind.

05:44.340 --> 05:50.150
King Bojji, helping others is good, 
but you are the king of this land.

05:50.460 --> 05:54.860
Were you to catch a cold, you could 
not defend the country if necessary.

05:59.830 --> 06:01.620
Now, let's get going.

06:14.030 --> 06:15.250
Pippy!

06:17.030 --> 06:18.750
Pippy!

06:21.700 --> 06:23.120
Is something the matter?

06:23.410 --> 06:26.980
Well, our pet bird has disappeared.

06:28.060 --> 06:29.790
Pippy!

06:43.500 --> 06:45.680
You want to help them find their bird?

06:49.980 --> 06:53.540
Very well. There's no guarantee 
that we'll find it, though.

06:55.350 --> 06:56.860
Pippy!

07:00.160 --> 07:01.610
Pippy!

07:04.760 --> 07:07.160
I'm exhausted!

07:27.930 --> 07:29.080
Pippy...

07:53.800 --> 07:56.290
King, I have something for you.

08:01.910 --> 08:05.160
Old habits die hard. I sure 
did buy a huge loaf of bread.

08:05.520 --> 08:10.270
I doubt I can eat all of this by 
myself. If only Bojji were here...

08:18.820 --> 08:21.860
Hmm? What, are you hungry?

08:22.830 --> 08:24.860
Heh heh. You like it?

08:26.870 --> 08:30.330
Hmm? Where did you come from?

08:30.750 --> 08:33.290
I bet you've got a family 
or friends, don't you?

08:33.770 --> 08:37.280
If so, you should go home. 
They'll be worried about you.

08:38.580 --> 08:39.290
Hmm?

08:44.610 --> 08:49.330
Be careful flying home! 
And appreciate what you've got.

08:50.290 --> 08:53.770
I wonder... how Bojji is doing now.

08:58.890 --> 09:00.660
A leaf whistle.

09:14.430 --> 09:15.710
Pippy!

09:15.710 --> 09:16.650
It's Pippy!

09:21.540 --> 09:22.490
Pippy!

09:21.540 --> 09:22.490
Pippy!

09:40.350 --> 09:41.760
Oh, Pippy!

09:41.760 --> 09:43.300
Thank goodness you're all right.

09:44.550 --> 09:46.000
Sorry about that.

09:46.950 --> 09:49.350
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

09:47.990 --> 09:49.350
I'm so glad.

09:53.980 --> 09:56.590
Thank you, King!

09:55.560 --> 09:59.070
See you later! Thank you!

10:02.240 --> 10:06.380
It's great that Pippy got back 
safely, isn't it, King Bojji?

10:06.820 --> 10:09.650
Now, we should get back to the castle, too.

10:36.920 --> 10:41.270
I'd like to know where he is. See to it.

10:51.010 --> 10:55.500
Heh heh! I found a great spot. 
I think I'll turn in early today.

10:57.750 --> 10:59.310
My bed!

11:01.240 --> 11:03.970
Honestly, what's a guy to do?

11:11.940 --> 11:16.900
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

11:18.590 --> 11:21.050
<i>Resolving to meet up again 
with his dear friend,</i>

11:21.610 --> 11:23.330
<i>Bojji departs on a journey.</i>

11:24.700 --> 11:29.040
<i>And so, carrying on in his footsteps, 
his brother Daida becomes king.</i>

11:29.040 --> 11:33.250
<b>The Melancholy of King Daida</b>

11:29.970 --> 11:34.250
<i>The kingdom was about to 
take a new step forward.</i>

11:36.690 --> 11:37.730
Miranjo,

11:38.460 --> 11:41.830
how do you like living like this? 
Are you starting to settle in a bit?

11:42.150 --> 11:43.140
Yes...

11:45.000 --> 11:47.340
I know you're just trying to be stoic.

11:47.340 --> 11:47.920
Huh?

11:48.500 --> 11:51.800
You said you wanted to do something 
for the country, right?

11:52.350 --> 11:53.480
Yes.

11:53.480 --> 11:55.180
Give it a little while longer.

11:55.960 --> 12:00.030
There are those who still don't 
think too highly of us.

12:00.680 --> 12:02.320
Let's take things slowly.

12:04.020 --> 12:05.760
Thank you very much.

12:06.150 --> 12:09.120
I understand how you feel, King Daida.

12:12.710 --> 12:13.700
King Daida!

12:13.700 --> 12:15.520
What's all the fuss about?

12:15.890 --> 12:17.290
I'm terribly sorry, sire.

12:19.720 --> 12:21.780
We just received word 
that the Ranking judge

12:21.780 --> 12:23.500
will be coming to the castle soon!

12:26.750 --> 12:27.800
I see.

12:28.680 --> 12:31.090
Have the Big Four assemble 
in the throne room.

12:31.090 --> 12:32.470
I'll be there shortly.

12:32.470 --> 12:33.280
Yes, sire.

12:34.180 --> 12:36.880
Sorry, Miranjo. We'll talk again later.

12:45.030 --> 12:48.840
The judge, huh? Things are about to get busy.

12:53.340 --> 12:54.820
Lady Miranjo...

12:55.490 --> 12:57.910
What could she be doing in the library?

13:00.920 --> 13:04.010
The judge will be visiting 
the kingdom soon.

13:04.470 --> 13:08.500
As its king, I cannot afford 
to lose out a second time.

13:10.150 --> 13:12.120
I want you to train me.

13:12.530 --> 13:15.720
I need to be strong enough 
to defend the nation.

13:16.370 --> 13:17.240
Please.

13:19.250 --> 13:21.520
Then, Domas, let me spar with you.

13:23.300 --> 13:27.110
Dispose of Apeas and Sandeo 
for not voting for me.

13:57.000 --> 14:00.630
King Daida has been training ever 
since the day we heard, huh?

14:05.680 --> 14:08.810
Hmm. The look on his face has 
become much more favorable.

14:09.080 --> 14:12.060
Yeah. That is the look of someone 
carrying a country on his shoulders.

14:14.190 --> 14:15.350
We're not finished yet!

14:15.350 --> 14:16.290
King Daida...

14:17.600 --> 14:19.830
It is time for our meeting.

14:21.700 --> 14:24.710
Excuse me. That will be enough for today.

14:28.090 --> 14:30.380
Hey, what's the meaning of this?!

14:31.050 --> 14:34.140
What do you mean, 
construction has been halted?!

14:34.140 --> 14:36.750
I don't know what else to tell you.

14:36.750 --> 14:39.210
All I know is that until those above 
us settle on a reconstruction policy,

14:39.210 --> 14:40.930
all construction is on hold.

14:40.930 --> 14:43.570
Without a job to do, we can't make a living!

14:43.570 --> 14:46.210
Where are we on the matter of 
the deteriorating barracks?

14:46.210 --> 14:47.060
Sire,

14:47.350 --> 14:49.920
demolition work has gotten underway,

14:49.920 --> 14:51.930
but the decision of whether 
to rebuild the barracks,

14:51.930 --> 14:55.270
or whether to build something 
else has not yet been made.

14:55.270 --> 14:58.250
Why the holdup? What's taking so long?

14:58.250 --> 15:00.370
I-I beg your pardon, sire.

15:03.090 --> 15:07.750
I'll see if I can come up with any 
good ideas about rebuilding it.

15:08.030 --> 15:11.220
And if you have any ideas, 
feel free to speak up.

15:11.220 --> 15:12.480
Y-Yes, sire.

15:11.220 --> 15:12.480
Y-Yes, sire.

15:12.820 --> 15:15.680
Delaying construction is 
putting others out, as well.

15:16.140 --> 15:18.310
Continue the demolition as scheduled.

15:18.720 --> 15:20.120
As you wish, sire.

15:22.130 --> 15:23.080
Miranjo?

15:23.470 --> 15:25.640
King Daida, begging your pardon,

15:25.640 --> 15:27.710
but I need you to look 
over these documents.

15:27.710 --> 15:28.900
Right...

15:35.660 --> 15:37.120
Do you mean it, sire?

15:37.460 --> 15:39.950
Yes. I'd like to go as soon as tomorrow.

15:39.950 --> 15:42.700
There may be things we can 
find out by touring the town.

15:45.340 --> 15:47.050
I think that's a good idea.

15:47.850 --> 15:49.690
The people will also be delighted.

15:51.880 --> 15:53.370
It's King Daida!

15:53.370 --> 15:55.560
Imagine, him coming here!

15:55.900 --> 15:57.210
King Daida!

15:59.080 --> 16:02.990
Yes, we are aware that there is a dispute 
over the matter of the barracks.

16:02.990 --> 16:05.260
Now that the peace has been restored,

16:05.260 --> 16:08.190
there isn't much need to bother 
rebuilding the barracks at all.

16:08.190 --> 16:12.390
True enough. But if that's the case,
 what <i>should</i> we build?

16:32.450 --> 16:33.590
Are you all right?!

16:37.600 --> 16:38.650
Your cane.

16:40.960 --> 16:42.760
Wh-What is it?

16:44.500 --> 16:45.360
Th...

16:45.880 --> 16:46.920
...a...

16:48.400 --> 16:49.390
..n...

16:50.010 --> 16:50.650
...k...

16:52.130 --> 16:52.950
...s.

17:00.630 --> 17:02.930
"Thanks."

17:06.150 --> 17:09.370
Sorii, Bebin, can I...

17:10.180 --> 17:11.850
ever become the kind of king

17:11.850 --> 17:14.940
who can stand by the people, 
the way Brother did?

17:20.350 --> 17:21.640
Imagine,

17:21.640 --> 17:25.360
hearing those words coming from King Daida.

17:25.940 --> 17:29.490
Now Prince Bojji is the one 
King Daida wants to be like?

17:29.490 --> 17:32.360
Hurry! There's been an accident 
at the barracks demolition site!

17:32.360 --> 17:34.460
Someone's been pinned under the rubble!

17:38.170 --> 17:41.170
Damn it, it won't budge!

17:40.290 --> 17:41.170
Hang in there!

17:43.830 --> 17:45.090
Bebin! Sorii!

17:45.090 --> 17:46.780
K-King Daida?

17:46.780 --> 17:47.920
Let's lift it off him!

17:47.920 --> 17:48.630
Right!

17:48.630 --> 17:50.220
Ready, set...

17:58.210 --> 18:00.000
M-My arm!

18:00.000 --> 18:02.050
Just sit tight! You'll be fine!

18:08.250 --> 18:09.960
Oh, amazing!

18:09.960 --> 18:11.310
He's healing him!

18:14.240 --> 18:17.260
King Daida! Thank you so much!

18:17.260 --> 18:19.480
Hmph, you're making too much of it.

18:19.480 --> 18:20.810
Not just for that!

18:20.810 --> 18:24.440
We heard that you were the one who 
let the construction start up again!

18:24.440 --> 18:28.190
That's right! We've been able to work 
today because of you, King Daida!

18:28.190 --> 18:29.630
Yeah! Yeah!

18:28.840 --> 18:30.950
Thank you very much!

18:30.950 --> 18:33.420
Yeah, King Daida!

18:33.420 --> 18:35.550
Thank you very much!

18:37.160 --> 18:40.040
You are starting to feel right 
at home as king, aren't you?

18:40.040 --> 18:40.810
Hmph!

18:41.330 --> 18:42.890
No one asked you.

18:43.460 --> 18:44.730
King Daida,

18:45.060 --> 18:47.460
there is something I have to tell you.

18:48.010 --> 18:50.210
Miranjo came all the way out here?

18:50.210 --> 18:54.280
Yes. Apparently, she has been 
visiting here for a month now.

19:02.790 --> 19:05.500
Okay, everyone, hold out your hands.

19:07.820 --> 19:11.040
You do know what will happen...

19:11.390 --> 19:13.470
if you mess this up, don't you?

19:15.660 --> 19:16.720
Here we go.

19:19.170 --> 19:20.140
Miranjo!

19:23.770 --> 19:25.850
"Hello"!

19:26.750 --> 19:28.570
Hello...

19:29.030 --> 19:30.450
King Daida?

19:35.370 --> 19:38.050
I had no idea you were teaching 
the children to read, write,

19:38.050 --> 19:40.180
and even sign, too.

19:40.180 --> 19:42.010
I apologize for not telling you.

19:42.770 --> 19:47.560
The children kept begging me 
to read books to them, so...

19:49.100 --> 19:55.550
When they said thanks, I just went 
ahead and ended up teaching them...

20:03.360 --> 20:06.190
Teacher, come play with us!

20:08.730 --> 20:12.380
Tell me, are your teacher's 
lessons easy to follow?

20:12.380 --> 20:15.710
Mm-hmm! I can do addition now!

20:15.710 --> 20:16.780
You can?

20:16.780 --> 20:19.160
I've gotten so I can read books!

20:19.160 --> 20:21.100
You have? That's great.

20:21.100 --> 20:23.790
I can read books now, too!

20:23.790 --> 20:24.640
Is that right?

20:24.640 --> 20:25.370
Me too!

20:24.870 --> 20:25.940
Me too!

20:25.490 --> 20:27.020
Me too!

20:32.700 --> 20:33.750
Miranjo...

20:33.750 --> 20:34.530
Yes?

20:35.130 --> 20:36.610
Let's start a school.

20:37.240 --> 20:37.910
Huh?

20:41.620 --> 20:44.510
I've been thinking about what to 
build on the site of the barracks.

20:45.450 --> 20:48.800
I'm building a school. You'll teach there.

20:49.240 --> 20:52.520
For the country's future, 
as well as the children's.

20:53.350 --> 20:54.470
Will you do it?

20:56.280 --> 20:57.170
Miranjo...

20:59.750 --> 21:00.490
Yes.

21:04.680 --> 21:05.370
Yes!

21:05.880 --> 21:08.680
Thank you so much, King Daida.

21:20.340 --> 21:32.350
<i>Your precious words are now 
fluttering through the sky</i>

21:35.640 --> 21:41.360
<i>The nights when I was alone 
still had countless stars</i>

21:41.360 --> 21:46.490
<i>Even now, they're close at 
hand whenever I close my eyes</i>

21:46.990 --> 21:49.990
<i>With no destination, I kept on walking</i>

21:49.990 --> 21:52.830
<i>Although I was tired, I kept on walking</i>

21:52.830 --> 21:58.500
<i>I just wanted to remain in prayers forever</i>

21:58.500 --> 22:01.420
<i>Covered in scars, covered in mud</i>

22:01.420 --> 22:04.210
<i>stretching out hands that won't reach</i>

22:04.210 --> 22:14.020
<i>I want to seize a fragment of my 
hopes and dreams right this minute</i>

22:14.430 --> 22:20.190
<i>Keep smiling, keep smiling, 
you don't have to be strong</i>

22:20.190 --> 22:27.610
<i>That sweet smile, that 
sweet smile is all you need</i>

22:27.610 --> 22:32.200
<i>Your unique smile brings 
the power and strength</i>

22:32.200 --> 22:38.670
<i>to chase away all the clouds</i>

22:38.670 --> 22:49.010
<i>Your precious words are now 
fluttering through the sky</i>
